  <item>
    <title>EP02.专属INFP的探讨｜走出半生，归来仍是最好的流泪猫猫头</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62bfedbaffa3b62fed6a9bf8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62bfedbaffa3b62fed6a9bf8</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 02 Jul 2022 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><strong><span>本期摘要：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>近两年MBTI16人格测试突然火了起来，大家都在津津乐道的讨论各自的人格类型，尤其是INFP，热衷于探索了解自己，Axu和Dekuan两位主播也正是因此结缘相识。</span></p><span></span><p><span>同为 INFP，我们会有很多共性，但没想到深入探讨下来发现两个人还是有很大的差异，Axu和Dekuan从男女不同视角去讲述自己关于INFP的成长故事和看法建议。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们风尘仆仆地前行，享受过晴天朗日，经历过雨打风吹，才发现生命最好的状态，不过是半生归来，依旧善良且真诚，惟愿你历尽千帆，不染风尘。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ps：如果你也想加入我们的讨论，也欢迎你在评论区留言，可以添加主播的联系方式以及群聊，期待你的到来🎉</span></p><span></span><h1><strong><span>节点指路：</span></strong></h1><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">1:10</a> INFP之间的“吸引力法则”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="335">5:35</a> 喜欢向内探索，对外却以观察者的姿态去与世界相处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="555">9:15</a> 理想主义：从内心出发，佛系但有底线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">13:20</a> 共情能力强的治愈系小天使</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="998">16:38</a> 永远真诚且喜欢真诚的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1233">20:33</a> 缺少安全感的INFP的进阶之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1485">24:45</a> 害怕孤独但更享受独处的充电方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1678">27:58</a> 流泪猫猫头.jpg</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1887">31:27</a> 改变emo状态的快乐清单</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2135">35:35</a> 高敏感？但仍然相信自己值得</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2365">39:25</a> 我们会喜欢的人格特质</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2944">49:04</a> 拖延症晚期怎么办</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3105">51:45</a> Dekuan的一些心得总结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3195">53:15</a> Axu的一些期望与祝福</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong><span>Axu、Dekuan</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期剪辑：</span></strong><span>Axu</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期文案</span></strong><span>：Axu</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期配乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>California Dreaming--The Mamas,The Papas</span></p><span></span><p><span>☾--沙皮</span></p><span></span><p><span>Imagine --John Lennon</span></p>]]></description>
