  <item>
    <title>EP01. 人生失控时，自洽的本质是一场勇敢的自我救赎</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62a1c3efd02ea2b34ca88897</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62a1c3efd02ea2b34ca88897</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 09 Jun 2022 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《別來無恙》诞生啦🎉🎉🎉</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期摘要：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《別來無恙》的由来趣事以及播客计划。</span></p><span></span><p><span>面对外在环境和内心虚无带来的人生失控，Axu和Dekuan都经历了些什么？我们是否只能被动选择接受这一切？</span></p><span></span><p><span>“精神自洽”是如今每个人都需要学习的课题，一切的出发点和落脚点都应该是自己。</span></p><span></span><p><span>拋弃自我，何来人生？人间喜乐总是与苦难并行，偏爱自己，勇往直前的大踏步向前走，人生本来就是一场历经磨难后的自我救赎。</span></p><span></span><p><span>一个人只有悦纳自己，才能真正地掌握自己的命运。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>节点指路：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="183">3:03</a> “人生失控”的出现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="316">5:16</a> Axu对失控人生的自我救赎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="916">15:16</a> Dekuan自洽的开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1035">17:15</a> 我们这一生就是在走出偏见，在后续的日子里慢慢承认自己的平凡，脚踏实地仰望星空</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1254">20:54</a> 自洽就是自我逻辑闭环，过程比结果更重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1327">22:07</a> 对于如何自洽的一些方法论，重新构建自我生命力，评判成功的标准永远不是单一的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1855">30:55</a> B站up主“小翔哥”自洽的经历，精神世界的富足才不会感到虚无</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1956">32:36</a> 勇于接纳自己的好与不好，并放弃无效社交、培养兴趣爱好带来的正面反馈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2145">35:45</a> 进行持续“自我教育”的重要性，保持输入的同时还要有适当的输出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2527">42:07</a> 卢梭说：人生而自由，却无往不在枷锁之中</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> 结束语：好好活着，去感受真正的爱与快乐</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong><span>Axu、Dekuan</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期剪辑：</span></strong><span>Dekuan</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期文案</span></strong><span>：Axu</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期配乐：</span></strong><br><span>You &nbsp;So &nbsp;--- &nbsp;I Mean Us</span></p><span></span><p><span>As She Passes --- Levi Patel</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrpM8nmNijbvZuAqWgZCSCMgUYsp.m4a" length="55341515" type="audio/mp4"/>
